* =====================================================================
* OpenCruise PWR-CTRL  -  SPICE model library (ngspice / KiCad 9)
* Fidelity: "good enough" for timing, DC levels, clamp voltages, inrush.
* Sources: classic public models (1N4148, 2N3904 = MMBT3904) and
* parameters fitted to datasheet key points (marked FIT). Behavioral
* models (marked BEH) for ICs without vendor SPICE models.
* =====================================================================

* ---------------- diodes ----------------
* 1N4148W  (classic public model)
.model D1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=0.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 tt=20n bv=100 ibv=100u)
* SS34 Schottky 40V 3A  FIT: Vf 0.40V@1A / 0.50V@3A, Cj ~250pF
.model DSS34 D(Is=20u Rs=0.035 N=1.10 Cjo=250p M=0.5 Vj=0.35 bv=45 ibv=500u)
* B5819W Schottky 40V 1A FIT: Vf 0.45V@1A
.model DB5819 D(Is=6u Rs=0.06 N=1.08 Cjo=110p M=0.45 bv=45 ibv=1m)
* BZT52C3V6 zener FIT: Vz 3.6V@5mA, Zzt ~90ohm. DZ3V6 = soft knee (typical low-voltage
* zener, ~10-100uA already at 2.5-3V) -> default / pessimistic.
* DZ3V6_SHARP = sharp knee (little leakage below 3V) -> optimistic corner (TB6).
.model DZ3V6_SHARP D(Is=1e-12 Rs=10 N=1.0 bv=3.5 ibv=5m nbv=1.5 Cjo=150p)
.model DZ3V6 D(Is=1n Rs=10 N=1.0 bv=3.42 ibv=5m nbv=6 Cjo=150p)
* Unidirectional TVS: BV at 1mA, Rs fitted so Vc(Ipp) = datasheet clamp
* SMAJ20A: VBR 22.2V, Vc 32.4V @12.3A -> Rs 0.83
.model DSMAJ20A D(Is=1e-12 N=1.0 Rs=0.83 bv=22.2 ibv=1m nbv=1.2 Cjo=2n)
* SMAJ24A: VBR 26.7V, Vc 38.9V @10.3A -> Rs 1.18
.model DSMAJ24A D(Is=1e-12 N=1.0 Rs=1.18 bv=26.7 ibv=1m nbv=1.2 Cjo=1.5n)
* SM8S20A: VBR 22.2V, Vc 32.4V @204A -> Rs 0.05
.model DSM8S20A D(Is=1e-10 N=1.0 Rs=0.05 bv=22.2 ibv=5m nbv=1.2 Cjo=20n)
* LED red 0603 (Vf ~2.0V @ 3mA)
.model DLEDR D(Is=1e-19 N=1.8 Rs=8 Cjo=10p)

* ---------------- transistors ----------------
* MMBT3904 (= 2N3904 public model)
.model QMMBT3904 NPN(Is=6.734f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=74.03 Bf=416.4 Ne=1.259 Ise=6.734f Ikf=66.78m Xtb=1.5 Br=.7371 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=1 Cjc=3.638p Mjc=.3085 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=4.493p Mje=.2593 Vje=.75 Tr=239.5n Tf=301.2p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=2 Rb=10)
* BSS138 (level-1 FIT: Vth ~1.2V, Rds 3.5ohm@4.5V / 5.6ohm@2.75V, Ciss 50pF)
.model NBSS138 NMOS(Level=1 Vto=1.2 Kp=0.105 Lambda=0.01 Rd=0.5 Rs=0.5 Cgso=20p Cgdo=6p Cbd=10p)
* 2N7002K (level-1 FIT: Vth ~1.6V, Rds 1.4ohm@5V)
.model N2N7002K NMOS(Level=1 Vto=1.6 Kp=0.6 Lambda=0.01 Rd=0.25 Rs=0.25 Cgso=25p Cgdo=4p Cbd=15p)

* ---------------- BEH: 74LVC1G17 Schmitt buffer @ VCC 3.3V ------------
* VT+ ~1.8V, VT- ~1.0V (datasheet typ @3.3V), push-pull ~25ohm, Ioff: input
* draws nothing when unpowered. Implemented with a hysteretic switch.
.subckt LVC1G17 A Y VCC GND PARAMS: VTP=1.8 VTN=1.0
* Schmitt buffer, Ron 25 ohm. Thresholds at VCC=3.3V: VT+ = VTP, VT- = VTN
* (74LVC1G17 datasheet @3.0-3.6V: VT+ 1.3-2.2V?, VT- 0.6-1.2V? -> check the sheet you use).
* S1 (VCC-Y) is driven by A and S2 (Y-GND) by the mirrored node (VTP+VTN)-A, so the two
* switches are complementary and share the same thresholds.
S1 VCC Y A GND SWSCH
Binv ainv GND V = {VTP+VTN} - V(A,GND)
S2 Y GND ainv GND SWSCH
.model SWSCH SW(Vt={(VTP+VTN)/2} Vh={(VTP-VTN)/2} Ron=25 Roff=1e8)
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: Omron G2RL-1A-E DC12 relay ----------------
* Coil 360ohm (400mW @12V), L ~0.4H (estimate).  Must-operate 75% (9V ->
* 25mA), must-release 10% (1.2V -> 3.3mA).  Operate/release ~10ms/5ms via RC.
* Contact Ron 10mohm (100mohm datasheet max incl. terminals).
* Preferred: armature follows coil VOLTAGE (operate 9.0V, release 1.2V)
.subckt G2RLV COILP COILN C1 C2
Lc COILP n1 0.4
Rc n1 COILN 360
Barm arm 0 V = abs(V(n1,COILN))
Rarm arm armd 10k
Carm armd 0 1u
S1 C1 C2 armd 0 SWCONTV
.model SWCONTV SW(Vt=5.1 Vh=3.9 Ron=0.01 Roff=1e8)
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: TJA1021 LIN/K-line transceiver ----------------
* TXD low -> LIN pulled low (Ron 40ohm, slope ~2us).  TXD dominant time-out
* 27ms (min) modelled with an RC timer: after 27ms low the driver releases.
* RXD (open drain) low when LIN < 0.4*VBAT, high when > 0.6*VBAT.
* Internal 30k responder pull-up + series diode to VBAT.
.subckt TJA1021 TXD RXD LIN VBAT GND
* timeout timer: C charges while TXD low; reset when TXD high
Btlow tl GND V = 0.5*(1-tanh((V(TXD,GND)-0.8)/0.05))
Rt tl tt 27k
Ct tt GND 1u
Dtr tt tl DIDEAL
* driver enabled when TXD low AND timer not expired (tt < 0.632V)
Bdrv en GND V = 5*V(tl,GND)*0.5*(1-tanh((V(tt,GND)-0.632)/0.005))
Rsl en ens 2k
Csl ens GND 1n
S1 LIN GND ens GND SWDRV
.model SWDRV SW(Vt=2.5 Vh=0.5 Ron=40 Roff=1e8)
Rres VBAT nr 30k
Dres nr LIN DIDEAL
* receiver
Brx rxi GND V = 2.5*(1-tanh((V(LIN,GND)-0.5*V(VBAT,GND))/0.1))
S2 RXD GND rxi GND SWRX
.model SWRX SW(Vt=2.5 Vh=0.5 Ron=50 Roff=1e8)
.model DIDEAL D(Is=1e-14 N=1 Rs=0.1)
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: XL7015 buck (averaged, large-signal) ----------------
* Vout = 5.30V regulated while VIN > Vout+1.2V (dropout), else tracks VIN-1.2.
* Input current = Pout / (eta * VIN), eta 0.82.  Current limit 1.2A.
* UVLO: off below 4.5V.  For start-up / hold-up / crank studies, not loop.
.subckt XL7015AVG VIN VOUT GND
* averaged buck: Vout = min(5.30, Vin-1.2), soft UVLO around 4.5V, efficiency 82%
* (tanh() is used instead of if/else so the simulator does not stall at the edge)
Ben en GND V = 0.5*(1+tanh((V(VIN,GND)-4.5)/0.1))
Bout vo GND V = V(en,GND) * max(min(5.30, V(VIN,GND)-1.2), 0)
Ro vo VOUT 0.05
Bin VIN GND I = max(V(VOUT,GND),0)*max((V(vo,GND)-V(VOUT,GND))/0.05,0)/(0.82*max(V(VIN,GND),1))
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: DFR0946 + PC as constant-power load ----------------
* P = PLOAD (W) at the DFR0946 input while VIN > 6V (DFR UVLO), else 0.
* Input capacitance CIN of the module.
.subckt DFRLOAD VIN GND PARAMS: PLOAD=67 CIN=440u ESR=0.03
* DFR0946 + laptop as a constant-power load (PLOAD in W at the DFR input).
* Turns off smoothly below about 6V (DFR0946 minimum input).
Cin VIN cn {CIN} ic=0
Rcin cn GND {ESR}
Bp VIN GND I = {PLOAD}/max(V(VIN,GND),3) * 0.5*(1+tanh((V(VIN,GND)-6)/0.15))
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: XIAO ESP32S3 load on 5V ----------------
* ~100mA average with 350mA WiFi bursts; MCU brown-out if 5V < 3.6V.
.subckt XIAOLOAD V5 GND
* ~100mA with 350mA WiFi bursts (2ms every 20ms); current fades out below ~3V
Vp ip GND PULSE(0.10 0.35 0 1u 1u 2m 20m)
Bl V5 GND I = V(ip,GND) * pwr(max(V(V5,GND),0),6)/(pwr(max(V(V5,GND),0),6)+729)
.ends

* ================= v2.x additions =================
* ---------------- BEH: AMS1117-3.3 LDO ----------------
* Vout = 3.30V while VIN > 3.3+VDO, dropout VDO ~1.1V (datasheet @0.8A ~1.1-1.3V), Iq 5mA.
.subckt AMS1117 VIN VOUT GND PARAMS: VDO=1.1
Bo vo GND V = max(min(3.30, V(VIN,GND)-{VDO}), 0)
Ro vo VOUT 0.05
Bi VIN GND I = max((V(vo,GND)-V(VOUT,GND))/0.05,0) + 5m*0.5*(1+tanh((V(VIN,GND)-2)/0.2))
.ends

* ---------------- sensor supply (v2.0): F4 -> C40/C41 -> U8 XL7015 -> +5VS -> U9 -> +3V3S --------
* Loads: I5 on +5VS (ports, PULSE-IN, I2C5/6), I3 on +3V3S (I2C1-4, GPS).  Averaged buck (XL7015AVG).
.subckt SENSORSUP VSW VSWEXT V5S V3S GND PARAMS: I5=0.3 I3=0.4 RPTC=0.15
Rf4 VSW VSWEXT {RPTC}
C40 VSWEXT c40n 100u
Rc40 c40n GND 0.3
C41 VSWEXT GND 1u
XU8 VSWEXT v5r GND XL7015AVG
C42 v5r c42n 100u
Rc42 c42n GND 0.15
C43 v5r GND 10u
Rs v5r V5S 1m
Bl5 V5S GND I = {I5} * pwr(max(V(V5S,GND),0),4)/(pwr(max(V(V5S,GND),0),4)+81)
XU9 V5S V3S GND AMS1117
C45 V3S GND 10u
C46 V3S GND 10u
Bl3 V3S GND I = {I3} * pwr(max(V(V3S,GND),0),4)/(pwr(max(V(V3S,GND),0),4)+16)
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: TJA1042T/3 CAN transceiver (VCC 5V, VIO 3.3V) ----------------
* Driver (TXD low & STB low): CANH -> VCC via diode + 20 ohm, CANL -> GND via 20 ohm + diode
*   -> Vdiff ~2.2 V into 60 ohm (datasheet 1.5-3.0 V).  Slope ~ 20 ns.
* Receiver: Rin ~25k per pin to VCC/2; RXD (push-pull to VIO) low when Vdiff > ~0.7 V
*   (datasheet threshold 0.5-0.9 V).  Bus pins limiting values +-58 V (checked in the testbench).
.subckt TJA1042 TXD RXD VCC VIO GND CANH CANL STB
Bdrv den GND V = 5*0.5*(1-tanh((V(TXD,GND)-0.5*V(VIO,GND))/0.1))*0.5*(1-tanh((V(STB,GND)-0.5*V(VIO,GND))/0.1))
Rsl den dens 1k
Csl dens GND 20p
Dh VCC h1 DCANDRV
Sh h1 CANH dens GND SWCAN
Sl CANL l1 dens GND SWCAN
Dl l1 GND DCANDRV
.model SWCAN SW(Vt=2.5 Vh=0.3 Ron=20 Roff=1e8)
.model DCANDRV D(Is=1e-14 N=1 Rs=0.5 bv=70)
Bcm cm GND V = 0.5*V(VCC,GND)
Rih CANH cm 25k
Ril CANL cm 25k
Cih CANH GND 10p
Cil CANL GND 10p
Brx RXD GND V = V(VIO,GND)*0.5*(1+tanh((0.7-V(CANH,CANL))/0.05))
.ends

* ---------------- BEH: PESD1CAN (bidirectional, 2 lines) ----------------
* VBR 26 V min, VC 36 V @1 A / 50 V @3 A (8/20us) -> two anti-series diodes, bv 27, Rs 3.5 each,
* Cd ~13 pF per line.  Pins: CANL CANH GND (SOT-23 pin 1, 2, 3)
.subckt PESD1CAN L H GND
D1 L x1 DPESD
D2 GND x1 DPESD
D3 H x2 DPESD
D4 GND x2 DPESD
Rx1 x1 GND 1e8
Rx2 x2 GND 1e8
Cx1 x1 GND 1p
Cx2 x2 GND 1p
.model DPESD D(Is=1e-13 N=1 Rs=3.5 bv=27 ibv=1m nbv=1.2 Cjo=26p)
.ends
